stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> RUNNING : startWorkflowInstance(workflowCode)<br/>businessKey 必填不超过 200 字符<br/>contextJson 选填但须为合法 JSON<br/>发起人取当前登录用户；固定 RUNNING

    RUNNING --> SUSPENDED : suspendInstance(id, reason)<br/>前端校验 reason 非空
    SUSPENDED --> RUNNING : resumeInstance(id, reason)<br/>前端校验 reason 非空

    RUNNING --> APPROVED
    RUNNING --> REJECTED
    RUNNING --> CANCELLED
    RUNNING --> TERMINATED

    APPROVED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    TERMINATED --> [*]

    note right of RUNNING
        4 条终态迁移由后端引擎驱动
        前端只提供发起 / 挂起 / 恢复
        （挂起用 suspended 布尔与 SUSPENDED 状态共同表达）
    end note